// Sign in with Google's way back into the app (google_sign_in, for the web
// shell's sign-in sheet: lib/features/dapps/native_sign_in.dart). It is the
// iOS OAuth client ID reversed: client "123-abc.apps.googleusercontent.com"
// is scheme "com.googleusercontent.apps.123-abc". Set it together with the
// GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID and GOOGLE_SERVER_CLIENT_ID dart-defines; until then
// this placeholder registers a scheme nothing opens, and the app does not
// offer Continue with Google.
GOOGLE_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID = com.onhomeroom.app.google-sign-in-unset
